---
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import IndustryResources from '../../../components/IndustryResources.astro';
import QuillajaSelection from '../../../components/QuillajaSelection.astro';
import ApplicationTasks from '../../../components/ApplicationTasks.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="饮料用植物提取物：茶饮苦涩与甜菊后味" description="面向饮料研发与采购，比较茶饮苦味、涩感及甜菊苦后味与甜味拖尾，衔接原料供货形态、具体试配方案和样品需求。" lang="zh" heroTitle="饮料" heroSubtitle="从应用条件到采购规格">
<section id="plant-based-ingredients" class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">植物基饮料中的茶与草本配料</h2>
<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">燕麦饮料中，燕麦基底提供稠感，茶原料带来茶味与颜色。本页选型聚焦茶提取物、果实来源粉末和植物甜味配料；植物奶基底及乳化稳定体系需另行确定。</p>
<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">试配绿茶燕麦拿铁时，可溶性茶提取物先单独溶解，不套用叶粉调浆步骤。在实际蛋白质、盐和 pH 条件下设置基底空白，比较加工与储存后的砂感、沉淀再分散性及热处理后絮凝。枸杞果汁粉则对应另一类果味冲调饮料，重点是载体、复溶和颜色，不作为植物奶基底。</p>
<a class="inline-block mt-4 text-primary underline" href="/zh/plant-extracts/ingredients/green-tea#formulation-oat-latte">绿茶燕麦拿铁：原料分工与试配顺序 →</a>
</div></section>
<div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><p data-tea-family-discovery class="my-6"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/products/tea-extracts">绿茶、红茶与乌龙茶：速溶粉及浓缩液项目</a></p></div>
<section data-pomegranate-discovery class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/pomegranate-flavour-selection">石榴饮料：先选风味方向，再讨论脱涩</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">区分鲜果与熟果香气、红色表现和收敛口感；总酚指标不能替代实际果汁选样。</p></div></section>
<QuillajaSelection lang="zh" />
<ApplicationTasks lang="zh" industry="beverages" />
<section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl">
<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-10">植物原料应在实际饮料体系中评估，而非仅以水中表现判断。透明度、口味和储存表现取决于完整配方及工艺。</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-6">应用排查与验证</h2><div class="space-y-5">
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">浑浊或沉淀</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">在目标pH、水硬度和添加量下比较溶解与分散情况。更换原料前，排查载体、过滤和加料顺序的影响。</p></div>
<div id="tea-bitterness-astringency" class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">茶饮苦味、涩感与颜色变化</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">苦味是味觉，涩感是口腔干燥、收敛的感觉，试配时应分别记录。在相同水质、酸味和甜味体系中比较绿茶提取物样品及添加量，避免将原料差异与基底变化混为一谈。热处理后及储存期间，在目标包装中复查苦味、涩感与颜色。</p><a class="inline-block mt-3 text-primary underline" href="/zh/plant-extracts/ingredients/green-tea#formulation-citrus-tea">绿茶柑橘茶试配：加料顺序与苦涩评价 →</a></div>
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">工艺不匹配</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">中试应覆盖巴氏杀菌或热灌装条件。由配方与质量团队评估保质期及微生物控制。</p></div>
</div><div class="mt-10 p-8 bg-primary/5 rounded-xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">准备哪些信息？</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">饮料类型、pH、加工温度及时间、透明度目标、添加量和目标市场。</p><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">请同时提供产品、首单数量及所需文件。规格、样品和文件以实际可提供情况为准；认证及合规性需按产品和市场核查。以下建议为评估方向，不是配方或适用性保证。</p><a href="/zh/request-quote?request=application&amp;source=beverages&amp;application=beverages" class="inline-block mt-5 px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg">提交应用需求</a><a href="/zh/resources/downloads" class="inline-block mt-5 ml-4 text-primary underline">查看采购清单</a></div>
</div></section>
<section data-citrus-research class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/resources/blog/hesperidin-material-choice">水相柑橘黄酮：橙皮苷还是葡糖基橙皮苷？</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">比较未改性橙皮苷、葡糖基橙皮苷与含蛋白递送体系的研究依据；材料身份、溶解要求和目标市场条件应分别确认。</p></div></section>
<section data-hibiscus-research class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/resources/blog/hibiscus-color-endpoints">洛神花颜色：外观与色素含量是不同指标</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">洛神花复配果汁研究阅读：区分色度坐标与单体花色苷测定。</p></div></section>
<section data-citrus-bitterness-research class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/resources/blog/citrus-delayed-bitterness">柑橘汁放置后为什么变苦？</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">区分柠檬苦素生成速度与后期浓度，按目标饮料的加工和评价时间线比较原料。</p></div></section>
<section data-astaxanthin-research class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/resources/blog/astaxanthin-beverage-stability">虾青素饮料：液体与粉末的界面选择</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">区分橙红色外观、干燥后保留率与贮藏表现，按成品形态安排应用试验。</p></div></section>
<IndustryResources lang="zh" industry="beverages" />
<section data-cocoa-discovery class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/cocoa-selection">可可粉还是可可提取物？把巧克力风味与黄烷醇含量分开选</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">区分常规可可粉、保留黄烷醇的粉体与提取物，分别评价巧克力风味、组成和成品配方。</p></div></section>
<section data-ginger-discovery class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/ginger-selection">生姜原料怎么选：姜烯酚更高，不代表姜香更合适</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">把姜香与辛辣感分开选，结合干燥、提取和载体研究确认生姜原料的实际用途。</p></div></section>
<section data-beetroot-discovery class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/beetroot-product-formats">甜菜根粉怎么做成产品：三个亚马逊商品的不同思路</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">从三个卖家展示的甜菜商品，比较食品配料、大包装冲调与调味饮品的开发思路，不作功效或市场需求排名。</p></div></section>
<section data-botanical-comparison class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/butterfly-pea-protein-beverages">蝶豆花用于蓝色蛋白饮料：先确定显色范围，再研究蛋白相互作用</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">蝶豆花蓝色取决于pH、温度与蛋白糖盐体系。区分光谱衰减、蛋白结合和成品保色，再确定蓝色蛋白饮料的试样方向。</p></div></section>
<section data-botanical-comparison class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/monk-fruit-specification-numbers">罗汉果采购：看懂°Brix、甜苷V含量与“1:1代糖”</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">用具名规格、四款真实电商商品与模型等甜数据，区分Brix、罗汉果甜苷V含量、配料比例和1:1代糖用法。</p></div></section>
</PageLayout>
